{
  "id": "cmd-ur-sphinx",
  "name": "The Ur-Sphinx — Sphinxes",
  "description": "Commander, white, blue and black, based on the list \"Stolen Futures\" by LoneWolf87x (Moxfield, bracket 4: thirteen Game Changers, among them Consecrated Sphinx, Rhystic Study, Smothering Tithe, Force of Will, Mana Vault and Vampiric Tutor). The Ur-Sphinx leads the Sphinxes: Unesh and Urza's Incubator make them cheaper, Unesh, Tivit and Yennett draw and find free spells, Chancellor of the Spires, Dazzling Sphinx and Mnemonic Betrayal cast the opponents' spells, and Medomai the Ageless and Sphinx of the Second Sun give extra turns and beginning phases.",
  "fr": {
    "description": "Commander, blanc, bleu et noir, d'après la liste « Stolen Futures » de LoneWolf87x (Moxfield, bracket 4 : treize Game Changers, dont Consecrated Sphinx, Rhystic Study, Smothering Tithe, Force of Will, Mana Vault et Vampiric Tutor). L'Ur-Sphinx mène les Sphinx : Unesh et Urza's Incubator les rendent moins chers, Unesh, Tivit et Yennett piochent et trouvent des sorts gratuits, Chancellor of the Spires, Dazzling Sphinx et Mnemonic Betrayal lancent les sorts des adversaires, et Medomai the Ageless et Sphinx of the Second Sun donnent des tours et des phases de début supplémentaires."
  },
